<article class="page-shell">
  <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>

  <p>TT Media uses limited first-party technical cookies to maintain website performance, ensure stability, and support secure website operations.</p>

  <p>We do not deploy third-party advertising cookies or cross-site tracking technologies for behavioral profiling. Our goal is to provide a privacy-conscious news experience without unnecessary monitoring.</p>

  <p>By continuing to browse this website, you acknowledge that we may use essential cookies to support performance and security functions.</p>

  <p>You may disable cookies in your browser settings at any time, although this may affect some website functionality.</p>
</article>
